WEBVTT

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:22.779
The reason I jumped out the window

00:01:24.685 --> 00:01:29.554
Was because the
deep blue sky was so clear

00:01:31.058 --> 00:01:35.154
I was still uncertain about
the self I couldn't see

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:41.964
So I plunged out here, barefoot

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:48.809
There are things I can't explain
or do well

00:01:48.809 --> 00:01:54.645
That lie beyond the mirror
that I stare at so intently

00:01:55.716 --> 00:02:01.188
So I put my rumpled-up dream
in my pocket

00:02:01.188 --> 00:02:08.295
And make a promise to myself
in the sky, ten years from now

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:13.901
The future I've always
believed in is no mistake

00:02:13.901 --> 00:02:20.240
Because I'm sure I have stronger
feelings than anyone else

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:24.506
Tenderly

00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:36.222
