00:21:29.589 --> 00:21:30.556
Poem Composition

00:21:50.243 --> 00:21:51.403
President

00:22:23.442 --> 00:22:27.880
I can't lose heart, but
I'm not frantic either

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:31.317
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:22:31.317 --> 00:22:36.289
With extraordinary effort
and a little miracle

00:22:36.289 --> 00:22:40.726
I get the feeling that it'll be
rosy and shining soon

00:22:42.628 --> 00:22:47.133
My life in Tokyo is so smooth,
don't I look chic?

00:22:47.133 --> 00:22:50.403
I even did research on the most
trendy clothes

00:22:50.403 --> 00:22:55.007
Now clubs recognize me and
just let me in

00:22:55.007 --> 00:22:59.078
My favorites are my mini-skirts

00:22:59.078 --> 00:23:02.782
It's important to bond
with my friends

00:23:02.782 --> 00:23:06.652
So of course I have a cell phone

00:23:06.652 --> 00:23:14.293
I got it by working hard at a job
that I can't talk about

00:23:14.293 --> 00:23:18.397
I can't lose heart, but
I'm not frantic either

00:23:18.397 --> 00:23:22.034
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:22.034 --> 00:23:24.203
I don't know what I want to do

00:23:24.203 --> 00:23:31.575
It seems these facts of loneliness
keep pouring down

00:23:33.913 --> 00:23:37.983
I don't know why I feel so sad,
I can't even cry

00:23:37.983 --> 00:23:41.654
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:41.654 --> 00:23:46.492
When I hear "How are you holding up"
in that familiar voice

00:23:46.492 --> 00:23:51.054
It feels like something's tugging
at my heartstrings

00:23:55.334 --> 00:24:20.292
Next Happy Lesson

00:24:20.292 --> 00:24:25.286
